{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-90"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815920-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신이 램버스 별의 폐품 수거장에 들어서자, 수많은 쓰레기통이 쓰레기더미 안에서 환호한다","talkId":403815920,"textHash":"9267555371353037044","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/talk-403815920","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aee6adda3378de55","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815921-line"],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815921-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"제21회 쓰레기 요리왕 쟁패전의 챔피언으로서 관측 방지 배리어, 먹다 남은 헤일로 윙 버거, 알 수 없는 행성의 코인 등 관객들은 꽃다발 대신 쓰레기를 던지며 당신에 대한 기대감을 드러낸다","talkId":403815921,"textHash":"16531604482772823879","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/talk-403815921","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aee6adda3378de55","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815922-line"],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815922-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 덤덤하게 옆에 있는 도전자를 바라보았다. 타탈로브의 궁정 요리사인 엘롤린, 천 가지 쓰레기를 맛본 분자 식객 뤼세크, 그리고 유명한 쓰레기 미식가 잭포까지, 다들 까다로운 상대다","talkId":403815922,"textHash":"4902869056052528649","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/talk-403815922","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aee6adda3378de55","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815923-line"],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-talk-403815923-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"하지만 당신의 머릿속에는 승리의 메뉴가 정해져 있다","talkId":403815923,"textHash":"1379460747777345626","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/talk-403815923","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aee6adda3378de55","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-text-13151288360862983110-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다 같이 덤벼, 시간 없으니까","talkId":null,"textHash":"13151288360862983110","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/text-13151288360862983110","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"92491c832713dc83","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-90-text-5968055316899136116-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-90","missionId":"event-rogue-90","mission":"요리왕 쟁패전","scene":"요리왕 쟁패전","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"상대방의 쓰레기통에 쓰레기를 버린다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5968055316899136116","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:90/text-5968055316899136116","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3fd1205f25d6334f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"厨王争霸","bwikiRevision":59124,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12975","bwikiMission":"요리왕 쟁패전"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-r